This is a forum to sync up Xenomai development. Topics may include but
not limited to upstream/downstream project plan, status update, and
technical discussion, etc.

It's an open call, everyone interested in the Xenomai development is
invited to participate!

The call is held every second week, except for holiday phases. So far,
it is adjusted to fit Asian and European time zones but we plan to
provide an America-compatible slot as well. Please raise your hand if
you would join from any of those zones.

First public call:

    16th of December 2020, 7:00-8:00 UTC

Start of regular biweekly calls:

    13th of January 2021, 7:00-8:00 UTC

Thanks to Intel for hosting this!

